        a_hi: "Pattern yeh hai ki query params padho, ek dynamic filter object banao, aur usse sort/pagination ke saath query me apply karo — search term diya ho to filter.name me case-insensitive $regex use karo, category diya ho to filter.category seedha set karo, phir Product.find(filter).sort(sortOptions).skip(skip).limit(limit) sabko jod deta hai. Lekin real production me meaningful scale pe text search ke liye, dedicated full-text index use karna chahiye — MongoDB ka $text, Postgres ka tsvector, ya alag Elasticsearch instance — regex ki jagah, kyunki regex-based search index efficiently use nahi karta aur collection badhne pe badly degrade hota hai.",
