        a_hi: "Environment variables config/secrets ko source code se bahar rakhte hain, taaki same codebase dev, staging, aur production sab jagah sahi se chale bina hardcoded values ke. process.env inhe runtime pe expose karta hai, aur dotenv package development ke time local .env file load karta hai — jo kabhi git me commit nahi karni chahiye. Production me hosting platform usually environment variables directly de deta hai, ya ek dedicated secrets manager use hota hai, disk pe rakhi plain file pe depend karne ki jagah.",
