        a_hi: "RabbitMQ, Kafka, ya SQS jaisa message queue ek service ko ek event/message publish karne deta hai jise doosri service baad me asynchronously consume/process karti hai, isliye original request ko email bhejne jaise slow, non-critical kaam ke khatam hone ka wait nahi karna padta. Order create hone ke baad code order.created event publish kar deta hai aur near-instant response de deta hai, jabki ek bilkul alag worker us event ko consume karke apni speed se confirmation email bhej deta hai. Fayde: services ek doosre se decouple ho jaati hain, reliability milti hai (consumer thodi der down ho to retry ho jaata hai), aur traffic burst me load evenly handle hota hai kyunki queue spike ko absorb kar leti hai, database ek saath poora hit nahi khaata.",
