        a_hi: "Authentication jawab deta hai ki user kaun hai — login step ke through identity verify karna, typically credentials ko database ke against check karke aur success pe token issue karke. Authorization jawab deta hai ki us already-identified user ko kya karne ki ijaazat hai — uska role ya specific permissions ek diye gaye route/action ki requirement ke against check karna. Authentication hamesha pehle aata hai — bina yeh jaane ki request kaun kar raha hai, authorization checks ka koi matlab nahi.",
